  "title": "Test runs leak temp workspaces and write volume: make gate-run temp cleanup deterministic and measured",
  "outcome": "A full gate run (wrapper) leaves no new directories or files under the user TEMP folder and reports its temp footprint; leaked workspaces are a failure classified per test, not a best-effort stderr line.",
